  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/blob/39450623ab70513b8b5320f3e006b9af02ad453e/assets/banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"熊貓砍樹模組橫幅\"></p><blockquote>\n  <p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wjPt4vEfXb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1021703635178115122?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=lightblue\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpandas-falling-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/i2kUe4lq?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=green\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pandas-falling-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/880630?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=red\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Falling-Trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/PandaDap2006/Pandas-Falling-Trees/total?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;label=Github&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=white\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n  <p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pandalib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PandaLib-必備-1?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=gold\" alt=\"PandaLib\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric API-Fabric 必備-1?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=gold\" alt=\"Fabric API\"></a></p>\n</blockquote><h2>關於：</h2><p>熊貓砍樹模組讓每棵樹木都能像<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態樹木</a>一樣倒下，同時保留了原版 Minecraft 的樹木外觀。</p><p>只要原木和樹葉方塊屬於原木與樹葉的方塊標籤，此模組就能支援其他模組。</p><h3>支援版本與模組載入器：</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模組載入器</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Fabric</td>\n<td>1.20 – 1.21.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NeoForge</td>\n<td>1.20.5 – 1.21.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Forge</td>\n<td>支援已終止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>開發目標為 1.21.10 版本</p><h2>展示：</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/blob/39450623ab70513b8b5320f3e006b9af02ad453e/assets/showcase_falling_tree_large.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"樹木倒下展示\"></p><hr><h3>開發相關：</h3><h4>尋找特定版本的程式碼</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>1.21</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.10</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.0</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>1.20</strong><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/Pandas-Falling-Trees/tree/versions/1.20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.0</a></li></ul></li>\n</ul><h4>Kotlin DSL</h4><pre><code>repositories {\n    mavenCentral()\n    maven(\"<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frepo.pandasystems.dev%252frepository%252fmaven-public%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://repo.pandasystems.dev/repository/maven-public/</a>\")\n}\n\ndependencies {\n    modApi(\"dev.pandasystems:fallingtrees-common-&lt;遊戲版本&gt;:&lt;版本號&gt;\") // 通用版本\n    api(\"dev.pandasystems:fallingtrees-neoforge-&lt;遊戲版本&gt;:&lt;版本號&gt;\")  // NeoForge\n    modApi(\"dev.pandasystems:fallingtrees-fabric-&lt;遊戲版本&gt;:&lt;版本號&gt;\") // Fabric\n}</code></pre><hr><h2>廣告：</h2><blockquote>\n  <h3>感謝 <strong>Kinetic Hosting</strong> 對本專案的支持</h3>\n  <p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/ThePandaOliver/ThePandaOliver/blob/main/assets_for_readme/Support/kinetic_hosting_banner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"合作夥伴橫幅\"></a></p>\n  <p>透過我的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d476\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">推薦連結</a>購買的任何伺服器都將協助支持我與我的工作。</p>\n</blockquote><h2>授權條款</h2><p>本專案採用 GNU GPLv3 授權</p>",
